5. sonner (toast icons and stack behaviour)
-------------------------------------------
crates/butler-ds/assets/toast holds the status and close icons that sonner 2.0.7
(https://github.com/emilkowalski/sonner) draws in its toasts: the success, info, warning and
error glyphs and the close cross are sonner's SVG paths, and the toast stack's timings,
offsets and swipe rules in crates/butler-ds/src/ui/toast follow sonner's source and
stylesheet. The design system uses sonner as its toast library, so the native toast
matches it. No other sonner code is copied. sonner is MIT-licensed:

